Boot "Loading..." overlay: the window is black for the first seconds of a title.

- PS3RECOMP_LOADING_OVERLAY=1 makes the draw engine report rsx_draw_engine_loading_overlay() until the first presented
  frame with a lit pixel in it (three pixels are read back per frame meanwhile), or 3600 frames.
- rsx_loading_overlay.h renders the text on the CPU (5x7 bitmap font); the Metal backend draws it with its display blit,
  the Vulkan backend copies it over the swapchain image after the blit. The guest's surfaces are not touched.
- The D3D12 backend does not run the draw engine and has no overlay.

